 and $\sqrt{2\sqrt{22}}$. The operator norm of $A$ is the largest singular value, which is $\sqrt{2\sqrt{22}}$. Thus, the smallest positive real number $C$ is $\sqrt{2\sqrt{22}}$. \boxed{\sqrt{2\sqrt{22}}}
